                <div class="mb-5">
                    <h4 class="fw-bold">1. University of Copenhagen (UCPH / KU)</h4>
                    <p class="lead text-justify" style="text-align: justify">
                        The University of Copenhagen Denmark (UCPH), also known as KU, is one of the oldest and most prestigious universities in Europe. It offers a wide range of programs in English, making it a popular choice for international students. The university is renowned for its research in fields like health sciences, humanities, and natural sciences.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-3">Why Choose UCPH?</p>
                    <ul style="text-align: justify; list-style: disc; margin-bottom: 0">
                        <li>High global ranking and reputation.</li>
                        <li>
                            Diverse English-taught programs.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Beautiful historic campus in the heart of Copenhagen.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <div class="">
                    <img class="w-100" src="~/assets/images/blogs/denmark/Kommunehospitalet_(Copenhagen).webp" alt="Kommunehospitalet University"/>
