                    <h4 class="fw-bold">2. Technical University of Denmark (DTU)</h4>
                    <p class="lead text-justify" style="text-align: justify">
                        The Technical University of Denmark Copenhagen is a leading institution for engineering and technology. DTU is known for its cutting-edge research and strong industry connections, making it an excellent choice for students pursuing STEM fields.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-3">
                        Why Choose DTU?
                    </p>
                    <ul style="text-align: justify; list-style: disc; margin-bottom: 0">
                        <li>
                            Focus on innovation and sustainability.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            State-of-the-art facilities and labs.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Strong emphasis on practical learning.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <div class="">
