                    <h4 class="fw-bold">3. Copenhagen Business School (CBS)</h4>
                    <p class="lead text-justify" style="text-align: justify">
                        CBS University Denmark is one of the largest business schools in Europe, offering a wide range of programs in business, economics, and management. It’s a top choice for students looking to build a career in the corporate world.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-3">
                        Why Choose CBS?
                    </p>
